### 11.1) VERIFY إلزامي لمسار media الحقيقي

إذا مسّت الشريحة data entry أو product/store/banner/campaign media أو order proof media أو field visit media أو support/dispute attachments أو `dsh_media_assets` أو MinIO/S3 أو media upload UI أو Control Panel media input، يجب تشغيل تحقق media runtime كامل، وليس TypeScript فقط.

الحد الأدنى:

```powershell
Set-Location -LiteralPath "C:\bthwani-suite"

docker compose -f .\docker-compose.local.yml config
docker compose -f .\docker-compose.local.yml up -d dsh-postgres minio minio-init dsh-api

docker ps --format "table {{.Names}}\t{{.Status}}\t{{.Ports}}" | Tee-Object -FilePath "$RunRoot\docker-ps.txt"

docker exec bthwani-dsh-postgres-local psql -U dsh_local -d dsh_local -c "select to_regclass('public.dsh_media_assets') as dsh_media_assets;" | Tee-Object -FilePath "$RunRoot\postgres-media-table.txt"

$MediaFile = Join-Path $RunRoot "real-media-gate.txt"
"bthwani real media gate" | Set-Content -LiteralPath $MediaFile -Encoding utf8

$IntentBody = @{
  owner_type = "product"
  owner_id = "media-gate-product"
  media_type = "document"
  purpose = "attachment"
  filename = "real-media-gate.txt"
  mime_type = "text/plain"
  file_size_bytes = (Get-Item $MediaFile).Length
} | ConvertTo-Json -Compress

$Intent = Invoke-RestMethod `
  -Method Post `
  -Uri "http://localhost:8080/media/upload-intents" `
  -Headers @{ "X-Client-Id" = "media-gate-operator"; "X-Actor-Type" = "operator" } `
  -ContentType "application/json" `
  -Body $IntentBody

$Intent | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10 | Tee-Object -FilePath "$RunRoot\media-upload-intent.json"

if (!$Intent.intent.upload_url) {
  throw "MEDIA_GATE_FAILED: upload_url is empty"
}

Invoke-WebRequest `
  -Method Put `
  -Uri $Intent.intent.upload_url `
  -InFile $MediaFile `
  -ContentType "text/plain" `
  | Out-File "$RunRoot\media-put-result.txt"

$Complete = Invoke-RestMethod `
  -Method Post `
  -Uri "http://localhost:8080/media/$($Intent.intent.media_id)/complete" `
  -Headers @{ "X-Client-Id" = "media-gate-operator"; "X-Actor-Type" = "operator" } `
  -ContentType "application/json" `
  -Body (@{ actor_id = "media-gate-operator" } | ConvertTo-Json -Compress)

$Complete | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10 | Tee-Object -FilePath "$RunRoot\media-complete.json"

$ReadBack = Invoke-RestMethod `
  -Method Get `
  -Uri "http://localhost:8080/media/$($Intent.intent.media_id)"

$ReadBack | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10 | Tee-Object -FilePath "$RunRoot\media-readback.json"

if ($ReadBack.status -ne "active") {
  throw "MEDIA_GATE_FAILED: media status is not active"
}
```

استخدام document/text في gate مسموح لاختبار upload pipeline.
أما الصور والفيديوهات الحقيقية فتُختبر عند وجود شاشة أو flow إدخال خاص بها، ويجب حفظ evidence منفصل لها.

### 11.2) حراس لا تقبل report-only في شرائح الإغلاق

